            "dated": "2026-10-04T14:00:00+05:30",
            "bytes": "We are building Waldo, a place that connects selected conversations, remembers decisions, and helps people prepare their next step. Our prototype has a review screen and a commitment view. We want to make work easier to return to, and we would like feedback on which workflow to demonstrate next.\n",
