            "kind": "document",
            "id": "reviewer-1",
            "revision": "feedback-v1",
            "dated": "2026-10-04T15:00:00+05:30",
            "bytes": "Reviewer: Asha\nI could not identify the customer problem in this draft. I heard a list of prototype features, but I do not know whose concrete difficulty makes those features useful. Name the person and the situation before describing the prototype.\n",
