            "kind": "document",
            "id": "reviewer-2",
            "revision": "feedback-v1",
            "dated": "2026-10-04T15:30:00+05:30",
            "bytes": "Reviewer: Ben\nI could not identify the customer problem. The opening tells me what you are building before it tells me the problem the customer experiences. I would need a concrete example to understand the promise.\n",
